      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "实战决策树：先确认是不是 KV cache 限制吞吐或上下文；不是就别急着压 KV。是的话先测 FP8；仍 OOM 或排队严重，再比较 4bit / KIVI / TurboQuant / KVQuant。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "实战决策树：先确认是不是 KV cache 限制吞吐或上下文；不是就别急着压 KV。是的话先测 FP8；仍 OOM 或排队严重，再比较 4bit / KIVI / TurboQuant / KVQuant。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
